# Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
# personal settings.

## Ignore Visual Studio user-specific files
.vscode/
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
appsettings.*

## Ignore build output
bin/
obj/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.log
*.cache
*.csproj.user
*.pidb
*.mdb

## Ignore Rider IDE files
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## Ignore NuGet packages
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
packages/
.nuget/
project.lock.json
project.assets.json
PackageReferences.lock.json

## Ignore logs, database, and other runtime files
logs/
*.log
*.sql
*.sqlite
*.db
*.mdf
*.ldf

## Ignore Environment and Secrets
.env
secrets.json
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json

## Ignore coverage files
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

## Ignore Resharper files
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

## Ignore Docker files
**/Dockerfile
**/docker-compose.*
**/obj/Dockerfile

## Ignore compiled code
*.dll
*.exe
*.out
*.app

## Ignore testing files
TestResults/
.trx
coverage/
*.coverage
